; Unit sequences (objfpc): an operation the element or key type does not
; support is reported in the library, with the chain of specializations
; that leads back to the call (OrderBy on records without '<').
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -c %S/Inputs/seqops/orderby.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: sequences.pas:{{[0-9]+}}:{{[0-9]+}}: error: invalid operands to '<' ('TPoint' and 'TPoint')
; CHECK: sequences.pas:{{[0-9]+}}:{{[0-9]+}}: note: in the specialization 'TSeq<TPoint>.OrderBy<TPoint>' requested here
; CHECK: orderby.pas:10:7: note: in the specialization 'TArraySeq<TPoint>.OrderBy<TPoint>' requested here
